    <div class="breadcrumb" typeof="BreadcrumbList" vocab="http://schema.org/"><ul><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li> <a href="/events/">Upcoming Events</a></li><li> Shooting Sports</li></ul></div>	
	<article>
		
			<div class="events-container"><div class="events"><h2 class="event-month" id="events-october-2026">October 2026</h2><div class="event"><div class="event-date-container"><p class="event-date"><span class="event-start-date"><abbr title="Wednesday, October 7"><span class="event-month-part">Oct</span><span class="event-date-part">7</span><span class="event-day-part">Wed</span></abbr></span></p></div><div class="event-data-container"><h3 class="event-title"><a href="https://dwr.virginia.gov/events/archery-fun-shoot/">Archery Fun Shoot</a></h3><p class="event-locality">Richmond, VA</p><div class="event-description"><p>Come join DWR and Freedom Outdoors for a Fun Shoot! Our experienced instructors will be on hand to help with scoring, range etiquette, equipment, safety, and shooting tips. No experience or equipment is required. We will have recurve and Genesis bows available for anyone who needs them, along with the necessary gear. </p>
<p>Come enjoy a fun, relaxed, and welcoming environment while learning the basics of target archery and building your confidence on the range. Archers will have 2 minutes per end to shoot 3 arrows (10 ends total). Genesis archers will be shooting 10m. All other divisions will be shooting 18m. </p>
<p>Warm-up begins at 6:00 pm. Scoring begins at 6:30 pm.</p>
<p>To register through Freedom Outdoors, click the Registration button below. Once on the Freedom Outdoors website, click on the "RVA / DWR Archery" option to select classes/dates.</p>
</div><div class="event-metadata"><div class="event-location-container"><h4>Location</h4><ul class="event-location"><li class="event-location-name">Freedom Outdoors RVA</li><li class="event-address">6020 W Broad St, Richmond, VA 23230 (<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=6020+W+Broad+St%2C+Richmond%2C+VA+23230">map</a>)</li></ul></div><div class="event-schedule-container"><h4>Event Schedule</h4><ul class="event-schedule"><li class="event-schedule-date">10/07/2026 (6:30 pm)</li></ul></div><div class="event-fee-container"><h4>Fee</h4><ul class="event-fee"><li>$20.00</li></ul></div></div><div class="event-links-container"><a class="button cta" href="https://freedomoutdoors.us/classes-richmond/">Register</a></div></div></div><div class="event"><div class="event-date-container"><p class="event-date"><span class="event-start-date"><abbr title="Saturday, October 10"><span class="event-month-part">Oct</span><span class="event-date-part">10</span><span class="event-day-part">Sat</span></abbr></span></p></div><div class="event-data-container"><h3 class="event-title"><a href="https://dwr.virginia.gov/events/bowtober-youth-and-family-archery-workshop/">Bowtober Youth and Family Archery Workshop &#8211; Morning</a></h3><p class="event-locality">Disputanta, VA</p><div class="event-description"><p>This two-hour workshop will introduce participants 9 years old and up to the basics of archery through hands-on instruction. All equipment and sullies will be provided. A parent or guardian must stay with any youth participant for the workshop. This is a partnership workshop with the Luck Group and DWR.</p>
